{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Revive the restaurant passed down from your grandmother and aim for a three-star rating!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter a fairy tale world where you\u2019ll battle enemies and gather ingredients in action-packed,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">while also hiring and training staff to manage your restaurant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game offers a blend of <u><strong>restaurant management and fairy tale action</strong></u>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000</u></strong><u>Fairy Tale Action<strong>\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gather Ingredients</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into a fairy tale world and collect all kinds of ingredients!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat creatures, and you might just find rare, high-quality ingredients.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The more you gather, the more delicious dishes you can serve at your restaurant!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3173430/extras/\u98df\u6750\u96c6\u3081.gif?t=1741829222\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Fairy Tale Skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unleash powerful abilities inspired by fairy tale characters in battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use them strategically to turn the tide of the fight in your favor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3173430/extras/\u7ae5\u8a71\u30b9\u30ad\u30eb.gif?t=1741829222\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Cooking</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the ingredients you\u2019ve gathered to prepare delicious dishes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meals can restore your HP, inflict status effects on enemies, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you stockpile ingredients or cook up powerful meals to take down tough foes? The choice is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3173430/extras/RecipeWindow.png?t=1741829222\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u>\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000Restaurant Management\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Staff</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hire staff to work at your restaurant!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Assign them to roles that match their strengths to keep your business running efficiently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3173430/extras/ss3.jpg?t=1741829222\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>During Business Hours</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Various events occur while your restaurant is open!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Attracting customers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cleaning the restaurant</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Serving dishes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dealing with troublesome guests</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Handle these tasks efficiently to keep your customers happy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3173430/extras/\u7d4c\u55b6\u30a4\u30d9\u30f3\u30c8.gif?t=1741829222\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>\u00a0\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000</u></strong><u>Other Features<strong>\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u00a0</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Permanently boost your stats by eating special dishes during action sequences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new stages and recipes through exciting challenges!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u>\u00a0\u3000\u3000\u3000Streaming Guidelines\u3000\u3000\u3000\u00a0</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are free to upload and stream videos without prior permission, whether you are an individual or a company. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are no restrictions on monetization or gameplay coverage. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br> <br><i>Powered by \u201cCRIWARE\u201d.CRIWARE is a trademark of CRI Middleware Co., Ltd.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3173430?t=1741829222","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3173430?t=1741829222","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3173430/f144032f425da07da6d7583848ce823cade16ba2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741829222","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3173430/f144032f425da07da6d7583848ce823cade16ba2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741829222","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3518910,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Revive the restaurant passed down from your grandmother and aim for a three-star rating!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter a fairy tale world where you\u2019ll battle enemies and gather ingredients in action-packed,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">while also hiring and training staff to manage your restaurant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game offers a blend of <u><strong>restaurant management and fairy tale actio